  "bodyHash": "oX1dHgQwyug=",
  "content": "<p>大家好，這是一個裝飾模組，用於打造場景，並在創造永恆世界等過程中享受樂趣。它<span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">主要是一個為創造模式設計的模組</span>，但我盡量讓生存模式中也能進行合成。目前所有東西都可以合成，村民和災厄村民也不例外！！！<br><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1213919/description_6fdb6cc4-7ac6-4dfe-9e3a-26918a047caa.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"400\" height=\"210\"></p><p>每種村民職業都有三種型態</p><ul>\n<li>坐著</li>\n<li>躺下</li>\n<li>居中（村民位於兩個方塊之間的中間）</li>\n</ul><p>目前有草原村民、雪地村民、針葉林村民、沙漠村民和平原村民。<strong><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">我之後會加入所有類型的村民（叢林和沼澤）</span></strong>。你還可以擁有每個村民的帽子！</p><p>鐵魔像也是同樣的情況，但我額外加入了「損壞的鐵魔像」方塊（有裂紋變體）</p><p>我按照村民的相同模式加入了每種類型的災厄村民（幻術師、衛道士、掠奪者、喚魔者和女巫）。</p><p>還有骷髏方塊、馬骷髏方塊等等！</p><p><span style=\"color:#236fa1\"><a style=\"color:#236fa1\" href=\"https://discord.gg/tr4fqV8aan\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">我的伺服器 Discord</a></span></p><p><span style=\"color:#fff\"><strong>模組中的所有方塊都在下方截圖中</strong></span></p><p><span style=\"color:#95a5a6\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1213919/description_fba07a96-4eb9-416d-9b35-9e2878989530.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"452\" height=\"237\"></span></p><p><span style=\"color:#95a5a6\">懸掛村民與無頭村民</span></p><p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1213919/description_06a23145-1823-4c1d-902c-3174992dd561.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"453\" height=\"238\"></p><p>平原村民</p><p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1213919/description_9e2da6af-a1d6-46de-ae5f-e5fbdb461298.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"453\" height=\"238\"></p><p>草原村民</p><p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1213919/description_bf835a13-4ac7-4964-a4d9-2c6c07b24bd9.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"455\" height=\"239\"></p><p>雪地村民</p><p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1213919/description_12a31e44-a67e-4625-a3f5-631cc3e3c02d.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"454\" height=\"239\"></p><p>針葉林村民</p><p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1213919/description_4db7f5d4-eea6-431a-9cc2-9fa76152465f.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"455\" height=\"239\"></p><p>沙漠村民</p><p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1213919/description_54c7a2b5-a6ea-4afa-8e08-cc815e1e9476.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"451\" height=\"237\"></p><p>小村民</p><p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1213919/description_15641600-cbfd-4b92-b8a2-c08c1ed4ff31.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"451\" height=\"237\"></p><p>他們的帽子</p><p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1213919/description_4bd68b86-0c14-4669-88ca-493592eb012a.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"451\" height=\"237\"></p><p>流浪商人</p><p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1213919/description_65e4c03c-3313-4848-8aa4-d0b3dc35d567.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"400\" height=\"210\"></p><p>鐵魔像與損壞的鐵魔像</p><p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1213919/description_03a43ed2-2d1a-469a-b3e0-91bfd4c28a2e.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"400\" height=\"210\"></p><p>災厄村民</p><p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1213919/description_d201fc91-082d-4526-924b-3581c9312a31.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"400\" height=\"210\"></p><p>女巫</p><p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1213919/description_28a9f9d9-65ac-46c4-8477-e145e194f23d.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"453\" height=\"238\"></p><p>頭顱！！！！！</p><p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1213919/description_14126e43-18e3-423d-9439-21642265e2c3.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"457\" height=\"240\"></p><p>骷髏</p><p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1213919/description_7cc7de6e-046f-4937-b9eb-23007faa1812.png\" alt=\"\"></p><p>流髑</p><p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1213919/description_55c5d7ca-7cb5-4af0-b65b-6c53852b74aa.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"400\" height=\"210\"></p><p>燒焦的骷髏（類似凋零骷髏，但體型與普通骷髏相同）</p><p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1213919/description_d53cbe2e-1162-4d9b-a27a-165782e6052f.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"466\" height=\"245\"></p><p>馬骷髏</p><p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1213919/description_34b6adf4-6b52-4b3e-9266-9137363a4add.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"475\" height=\"250\"></p><p>可堆疊的鮭魚方塊、鱈魚方塊、有洞的木桶以及有洞且有蝌蚪的木桶。魷魚方塊（試著用剪刀剪他們 ;) ）以及每種類型的青蛙方塊</p><p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1213919/description_5f325687-2859-4bfa-89e3-bb96352725ab.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"475\" height=\"250\"></p><p>桶方塊</p><p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1213919/description_3f6ef19f-7635-4bb8-a601-be61470d253a.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"475\" height=\"250\"></p><p>插在地上的箭（45°）</p><p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1213919/description_93b93f79-92f2-44c4-8325-4c5ed7205ae5.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"475\" height=\"250\"></p><p>插在地上的箭（22.5°）</p><p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1213919/description_78421c6e-d299-4274-bc4d-4126b0cf543f.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"475\" height=\"250\"></p><p>許多（更好的）書櫃</p><p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1213919/description_08ae0aa6-b30e-4c3f-9f77-317a74e7520e.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"475\" height=\"250\"></p><p>一個墨水瓶</p><p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1213919/description_e4ad655a-9172-4ec3-b3a0-b7e9a78c8192.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"476\" height=\"250\"></p><p>大量紙張</p><p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1213919/description_3680c1a2-2cee-422f-8106-481f8164ed51.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"476\" height=\"250\"></p><p>一個天秤</p><p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1213919/description_1e41486c-f49a-4732-bcdf-efe09a23805c.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"477\" height=\"251\"></p><p>地獄玻璃</p><p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1213919/description_fef2590f-05e6-426e-8275-3a5e3bf299e2.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"474\" height=\"249\"></p><p>種子方塊</p><p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1213919/description_a392de11-b37b-480d-baa5-aad3e721f19e.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"476\" height=\"250\"></p><p>Alex 和 Steve</p><p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1213919/description_bc797a3f-5a78-4fce-8b66-b7fb2277bcc1.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"475\" height=\"250\"></p><p>最後，每個方塊都可以含水</p><p><span style=\"color:#e67e23\">感謝你閱讀完整個說明 :)</span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"color:#ba372a\"><strong>若要修復「平滑光照」導致方塊產生難看陰影的錯誤，請安裝 1.20.1 最新版本的 <span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">EMBEDIUM</span></strong></span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"color:#e67e23\"><strong>真的很抱歉這個糟糕的錯誤。目前我還沒有找到解決這個錯誤的方法，抱歉。</strong></span></p><h6 style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"color:#e67e23\"><span style=\"color:#fff\">你也可以使用像是 Iteration 這類能修復此問題的著色器。</span></span></h6><h6 style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"color:#e67e23\"><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1213919/description_d16ccbbd-61ef-4508-8987-81efcb88be46.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"389\" height=\"204\"></strong><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1213919/description_3c34e66c-926e-4b8a-ba33-23123e8a0562.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"396\" height=\"208\"></strong></span></h6><p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"color:#fff\"><em>未使用 Embedium&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; 使用 Embedium</em></span></p>",
